      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I recently contracted Brooksies Energy Solutions for the installation of a solar PV system on my property, and I couldn't be any happier with their services. From start to finish, they demonstrated a level of professionalism and customer service that was excellent.The team was incredibly easy to talk to as they patiently addressed all of my questions and concerns, making the entire process seamless and stress-free. Their expertise in solar energy was evident, demonstrated by the system design and capacity, as per the requirement I indicated in the questionnaire. Quoting system was really good, there is a short summary of the important aspects, and then also some detailed information for someone like me who like to do my own homework as well.One aspect that stood out was their quick response to queries. Communication is key for these jobs , and Brooksies was consistently prompt in addressing any inquiries I had. This responsiveness not only gave me confidence in their dedication but also ensured that the installation proceeded smoothly.The team presented me with a range of high-quality products, allowing me to choose the panels and inverter that best fit my requirements and budget. Their thorough explanations and transparency about the products made it easy for me to make an informed decision.In terms of price, the cost of the solar PV system and installation was not only competitive but also in line with the industry's standards for a system of such high quality and value. The transparent and fair pricing provided further assurance that I was getting excellent value.Flexibility in scheduling is often a challenge, but Brooksies worked seamlessly with my calendar. They accommodated my availability and this level of consideration for the customer's schedule is truly commendable.Upon completion of the installation, I was pleased to find that the team left the place clean and tidy. It was clear that they took pride in their work and respected my property. The owner and technician were on hand to do the install and we had good discussions on estimated duration of install, quality of products as well as explaining to me some safety notes, shut off and turn on of the system, consumption monitoring app, and the hot water timer. They also provided system manual and documentation and organized for grid connection and meter change to a smart meter.Most importantly, the system's performance has been exactly as quoted. I am experiencing the anticipated energy savings. The accuracy of their performance estimate speaks to their reliability and expertise.Throughout the entire process, Brooksies Energy Solutions demonstrated a commitment to delivering not only exceptional service but also cost effective solar PV installation and system. Their dedication to providing a quality product at a reasonable price, professionalism, responsiveness, and commitment to customer satisfaction reinforced my confidence in choosing them for my solar installation.",
